### Moderator Routes
### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@token = paste_admin_token_here

###

### Get all moderators for a topic
GET {{baseUrl}}/moderators/topic/1

###

### Get moderator by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/moderators/1

###

### Assign a moderator (admin only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/moderators/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "user_id": "paste_user_uuid_here",
    "topic_id": 1,
    "role": "moderator"
}

###

### Update moderator role (admin only)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/moderators/1?role=senior_moderator
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Remove a moderator (admin only)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/moderators/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
